  threshold="${CHECKPOINT_DRIFT_STREAK_THRESHOLD:-2}"
  [[ "$streak" =~ ^[0-9]+$ ]] || streak=0
  [[ "$threshold" =~ ^[0-9]+$ ]] || threshold=2
  if (( streak < threshold )); then
    return 0
  fi

  cat <<EOF

Worktree hygiene intervention:
- checkpoint_drift_streak: ${streak}
- checkpoint_drift_threshold: ${threshold}
- 当前工位已连续多轮处于 dirty/checkpoint 漂移，不应继续扩写实现。
- 先执行 \`skill:worktree-hygiene-supervision\`。
- 先更新当前阶段 continuity artifact、补最小验证、切原子 checkpoint commit；若 scope 已混杂，先按 ownership 分流到 dedicated worktree。
- 若你是主管，优先委派 hygiene 收口；若你是 worker，优先收口当前 issue，再继续下一批。
EOF
}

